  "description": "A case in which the Court held that a worker who handles goods on a purely intrastate (within one state) leg of a broader interstate journey qualifies for the Federal Arbitration Act's (FAA) \u00a71 exemption, even if the worker never personally crosses state lines or loads and unloads vehicles that do.",
